y reinvested throughout the competition. The process is simple: Buy \u2192 Create Value \u2192 Sell \u2192 Reinvest \u2192 Sell Again Transaction Tracking All transactions must take place in the presence of the assigned Team POC. The POC will record: Amount spent, Product\/service purchased or created, Selling price, Reinvestment amount, Final cash balance, Submission: Within 2 hours of the completion of the sales run, teams must submit a presentation of no more than 5 slides covering: Opportunity identified, Sales strategy, Reinvestment decisions, Challenges & pivots, Key learnings, Finish: Teams must return to the designated finish point with cash only. Unsold inventory, pending payments and future orders will not be counted towards the final score.","start_date":"2026-10-31T13:20:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-11-02T15:00:00+05:30","who_can_play":1,"round_config":null,"ai_interview_enabled":false,"status":"NOT_STARTED","can_evaluate":true,"seo_data":{"title":"Round 2: The Sales Run","keyword":"","description":"Offline Round as part of Cash Rush","sharable_image_url":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/lambda-pdfs\/opportunity-bannerImages\/1790176861.png","audience":"","entity_type":"App\\Model\\Opportunity","entity_id":1757061,"public_url":"\/competitions\/cash-rush-shatranj-30-the-entrepreneurship-weekender-ashoka-university-1757061\/offline-round\/1378570","keywords":"","seo_url":"https:\/\/unstop.com\/competitions\/cash-rush-shatranj-30-the-entrepreneurship-weekender-ashoka-university-1757061\/offline-round\/1378570"},"public_url":"\/competitions\/cash-rush-shatranj-30-the-entrepreneurship-weekender-ashoka-university-1757061\/offline-round\/1378570\/details","images":[]}],"status":"NOT_STARTED","display_only":true},{"id":1638224,"opportunity_id":1757061,"entity_id":1389428,"entity_type":"App\\Model\\OfflineRound","is_inactive":1,"is_hidden":0,"evaluation_fields":null,"subtype":null,"round_order":3,"players_count":0,"register_window":1,"eliminator_round":0,"r